{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029310001:2":{"text":"那个，请问你是理查爷爷吗？梅拉奶奶——","source_cn":"那个，请问你是理查爷爷吗？梅拉奶奶——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F1511690CE07F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029310002:1":{"text":"是梅拉让你们来找我的吗？她最近过得怎么样？还有瑞克……他们都还好吧？","source_cn":"是梅拉让你们来找我的吗？她最近过得怎么样？还有瑞克……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E4692DDF042F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029310003:1":{"text":"他们都挺好的，梅拉奶奶还泡了茶给我们喝！","source_cn":"他们都挺好的，梅拉奶奶还泡了茶给我们喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE4D64E1E444B926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029310004:1":{"text":"梅拉的手艺，一直是很好的，不管是泡茶，还是做馅饼。不过，你们是来？","source_cn":"梅拉的手艺，一直是很好的，不管是泡茶，还是做馅饼。不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFCE013899F563F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029310005:1":{"text":"理查爷爷，我们在调查圣石失窃案的真相，梅拉奶奶说你这里可能有线索可以提供！","source_cn":"理查爷爷，我们在调查圣石失窃案的真相，梅拉奶奶说你这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD519C319DE42A89E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fe